    <comment>- update to 0.5.9:
  * Did not properly specify how to find source files so 0.5.8
    wheel was broken. (In my defense I've used src&lt;package&gt;
    builds for almost five years now.)
  * Suppress warnings about SyntaxError: invalid escape
    sequences.
  * Switch to using pyproject.toml over setup.py.
- refresh new-pythons.patch: remove setup.py hunk as it no longer exists.

- Do not build for Python 3.6, due to no NumPy.</comment>
